    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing core treasury and accounting function</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2020-12-10" value="0%" year="2020"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-12-10"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-10"></period-end>
     <target value="50%">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite DGTCP was created and its managerial team appointed, logistical and regulatory challenges (IT tools, logistics protocols, roll-out of the network of public accountants and modification of the existing expenditure management IT system) required more time. 
